# The Bass line page (the LFO button's fourth page, after Drone LFO): the drone as notes. Mode, Length, Move, Glide; stored with the piece.
seed 0
wait 3000
adv 1
turn SELECT 8 100
expect view 8
expect par152 6
spin K1 2
wait 100
expect par152 8
spin K2 10
wait 100
expect par153 80
spin K3 10
spin K4 10
wait 100
expect par154 22
expect par155 10
shot bassline.png
# the mode names to the end (Riff, then the nine figures by name: Gallop last) and back
spin K1 20
wait 100
expect par152 15
spin K1 -30
wait 100
expect par152 0
